#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:21 84a3220925e54c038f1ca556622d9124
msgid ""
"Initializes the main :ref:`FmodSystem<class_FmodSystem>`, applies the project's ``audio/fmod`` "
"settings, and updates FMOD once per :ref:`SceneTree<class_SceneTree>` process frame. Access the "
"singleton through its static methods."
msgstr ""
"初始化主 :ref:`FmodSystem<class_FmodSystem>`，应用项目的 ``audio/fmod`` 设置，并在每个 "
":ref:`SceneTree<class_SceneTree>` 处理帧更新 FMOD。通过静态方法访问此单例。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:23 d5dd6136de9f413794040656b4aebd0c
msgid ""
"\\ :ref:`get_audio_bus_layout()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus_layout>` returns bus "
"configuration; :ref:`get_audio_bus_by_id()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus_by_id>` and "
":ref:`get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` return the "
"corresponding runtime objects. Each effect slot has an independent runtime instance. Changes to "
"the active configuration are applied on the next update, or immediately with "
":ref:`flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus_layout>` "
"返回总线配置，:ref:`FmodServer.get_audio_bus_by_id()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus_by_id>` 和 "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` "
"返回对应运行时对象。每个效果器槽位都有独立运行实例。当前配置的修改在下一次更新时应用，或通过 "
":ref:`FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>` 立即应用。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:25 141babfe28e34f218320c98c2510c1ba
msgid ""
"With ``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses`` enabled, Godot's :ref:`AudioServer<class_AudioServer>`"
" supplies the configuration. When disabled, the server loads ``audio/fmod/default_bus_layout``, "
"whose default is ``res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres``. Changing the synchronization setting "
"requires reloading the project. See :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` for "
"editing, saving, and the FMOD Audio Dock."
msgstr ""
"开启 ``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses`` 时，由 Godot 的 :ref:`AudioServer<class_AudioServer>` "
"提供配置。关闭后加载 ``audio/fmod/default_bus_layout``，默认为 "
"``res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres``。修改同步设置需要重新加载项目。编辑、保存和 FMOD Audio 面板的说明见 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`。"

