msgid ":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` **get_audio_bus_layout**\\ (\\ ) |static|"
msgstr ":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` **get_audio_bus_layout**\\ (\\ ) |static|"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:185 fcba463ed0aa48f68571285b8e2094fe
msgid ""
"Returns the current configuration resource. In independent mode, edits are applied to bound "
"runtime instances on the next server update, or immediately through "
":ref:`flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>`. In synchronization mode "
"Godot AudioServer provides the configuration; edit it through the native Audio panel."
msgstr ""
"返回当前配置资源。独立模式下，修改在下一次服务器更新时应用到绑定实例，或通过 "
":ref:`FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>` 立即应用。同步模式的配置来自 "
"Godot AudioServer，应在原生 Audio 面板编辑。"

