#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:197 73f94ddb891b45708f0b3990b3fa7733
msgid ""
"Validates and builds ``layout`` before replacing the current runtime graph. Playing channels move"
" to matching bus names or Master. Returns :ref:`@GlobalScope.OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>` "
"on success, :ref:`@GlobalScope.ERR_BUSY<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_BUSY>` in Godot "
"synchronization mode, "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_DATA<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_DATA>` for an invalid"
" resource, or an initialization error. This does not save the resource or change the project "
"default."
msgstr ""
"验证并建立 ``layout`` 的运行实例后替换当前图。播放通道转移到同名总线，找不到时转到 Master。成功返回 "
":ref:`OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>`；Godot 同步模式返回 "
":ref:`ERR_BUSY<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_BUSY>`；无效资源返回 "
":ref:`ERR_INVALID_DATA<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_DATA>`，初始化失败则返回对应错误。此方法不保存资源，也不改变项目默认值。"

