#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:209 dbae599e0ff04f5fa47efab7d396bfa7
msgid ""
"Returns the runtime bus named ``name``, or ``null`` when it does not exist. After adding a bus, "
"call :ref:`flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>` before requesting it "
"in the same frame. Direct runtime edits do not modify or save the layout configuration."
msgstr ""
"返回名为 ``name`` 的运行时总线，不存在时返回 ``null``。新增总线后，如需在同一帧获取，应先调用 "
":ref:`FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>`。直接修改运行时对象不会修改或保存布局配置。"

