msgid ""
"Returns the runtime bus with stable ``id``, or ``null``. Bus IDs remain stable when the layout is"
" reordered or a bus is renamed."
msgstr "根据稳定 ``id`` 返回运行时总线，不存在时返回 ``null``。调整显示顺序或重命名总线会保留 ID。"

