#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:233 a64fe764e0b94dbba526b621b304b731
msgid ""
"Returns the live effect instance of ``slot_id`` on ``bus_id``, or ``null`` if the bus or slot has"
" no applied runtime instance. After adding a slot, call "
":ref:`flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>` before requesting it in the"
" same frame. Use this instance for :ref:`FmodAudioEffectCapture<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture>` "
"buffers, :ref:`FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer>` snapshots,"
" and :ref:`FmodAudioEffectRecord<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord>` output. Each slot has its own "
"instance, even when slots share a configuration resource. Runtime edits are not saved; subsequent"
" configuration edits may update the instance."
msgstr ""
"返回总线 ``bus_id`` 的槽位 ``slot_id`` 的运行效果器实例，尚无已应用实例时返回 ``null``。添加槽位后，如需在同一帧获取，应先调用 "
":ref:`FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>`。通过此实例读取 "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffectCapture<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture>` "
"缓冲、:ref:`FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer>` 频谱和 "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffectRecord<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord>` "
"录音。共享配置的槽位也各有独立实例。运行时修改不保存，之后的配置修改可能更新该实例。"

