#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:281 f912e10891564118b93528b2a08bbe5c
msgid ""
"Creates an independent configuration from the current Godot AudioServer buses and supported "
"effects. Unsupported effects are skipped. This does not activate or save the result. The Dock "
"conversion command also reports skipped effects."
msgstr "从 Godot AudioServer 当前总线及支持的效果器创建独立配置，跳过不支持的效果器。此方法不激活或保存结果，面板的转换命令还会报告跳过项。"

