#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:305 62100b2b29134708b3ca7a9fdb9ce2b2
msgid ""
"Replaces the main system with ``system``. Configure and initialize the new system before calling "
"this method. Releases the previous runtime instances and system, then rebuilds the active layout "
"configuration on the new system. Objects from the previous system must not be reused."
msgstr "用 ``system`` 替换主系统，调用前需配置并初始化新系统。释放旧运行实例和旧系统后，在新系统上重建当前布局。旧系统的对象不可继续复用。"
